        <item>VI – Slight damage, hard to stand</item>
        <item>VII – Damage to weak buildings</item>
        <item>VIII – Considerable damage</item>
        <item>IX – Heavy damage, buildings shift</item>
        <item>X – Serious damage to most buildings</item>
        <item>XI – Few structures survive</item>
        <item>XII – Near total destruction</item>
